on, round/stage).\n\nDedup: BR-Football-Dataset overlaps other files; keep it but tag competition as its tournament value; simplest to keep all matches, and head-to-head across dataset. For h2h \"in dataset\" fine.\n\nLet me write files: `brazilian_soccer/__init__.py`, `data.py`, `analysis.py` maybe combined, `server.py`, `tests/test_brazilian_soccer.py`, `requirements.txt`, `README` update optional.\n\nWrite code now.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d913f6b0011pxoFkxvEMbzDv","sessionID":"ses_fa26fadadffe2UVfX81vYXdx41","messageID":"msg_05d91307f001VUKI75MQ3586az"}}
